[en.CHARACTER_SUNSET_SHIMMER_MISSING_NAME]
Sunset Shimmer

[en.CHARACTER_SUNSET_SHIMMER_MISSING_DESC]
I feel extraordinary, something’s got a hold on me.

I feel like I’m ready, suddenly free will’s what I see.

We might have gone too far, time and money’s all been spent.

I’m scared of you now, leaving me in that cruel world of torment.

§OI never thought this day would come, when I’d find solace in the light of dawn.§!

§OSunrise was my remedy that took me back to childhood, now it’s only fear that’s spawned.§!

§OI never thought this day would come, now I can only survive in the light of dawn.§!

§RSunset Shimmer, MISSING§!

[zh.CHARACTER_SUNSET_SHIMMER_MISSING_NAME]
余晖烁烁

[zh.CHARACTER_SUNSET_SHIMMER_MISSING_DESC]
我感到非同一般，有些事物让我彻底折服。

我感到蓄势待发，仿佛突然拥有了自由的意志。

我们可能已经走得太远，时间与金钱都已挥霍殆尽。

我现在害怕你，把我留在那个充满残忍压迫的世界。

§O我曾以为这一天永远不会来临，当我从日出的霞光中获得慰藉。§!

§O日出是带我回到童年的解药，而如今那里唯有恐惧。§!

§O我曾以为这一天永远不会来临，如今我只能靠日出的慰藉而活下去。§!

§R余晖烁烁，已失踪§!
